---
permalink: /en/contacto/
title: "Contact"
description: "Book your Palomino Islands tour on WhatsApp (+51 986 671 093). Also by email. La Punta, Callao, Peru."
---
{% set t = i18n[lang] %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>›</span> Contact</nav>
    <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">Contact</p>
    <h1>Let's talk on WhatsApp</h1>
    <p class="lead">The fastest way to book and ask questions. {{ t.weReply }}.</p>
    <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      <div class="card"><div class="card__body stack">
        <h3>WhatsApp</h3>
        <p style="font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)">{{ site.whatsappDisplay }}</p>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary)">🕐 {{ t.hours }}.</p>
      </div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card__body stack">
        <h3>Other channels</h3>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
        <p>Location: {{ site.location }}<br><small>The exact boarding address is shared when you book. <span class="pending">{{ t.pending }} (E4)</span></small></p>
        <p>Social:
          <a href="{{ site.social.facebook }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Facebook</a> ·
          <a href="{{ site.social.instagram }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Instagram</a> ·
          <a href="{{ site.social.youtube }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">YouTube</a>
        </p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
